  "description": "*“Wanna suck me off?”*\n\nJi-Han gets caught by Shin-U having a crush on a guy. To keep it a secret, Ji-Han ends up facing sexual demands he never imagined from Shin-U. To make matters worse, when a stalker targets Shin-U—his bodyguard client and a popular star—they end up living under the same roof...\n\nKim Shin-U, the spoiled younger man who acts however he pleases, and Ji-Han, who resents him yet finds himself helplessly swept along. How will their tangled relationship ever untangle?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
